title:
Plot filled polygons.

# Example: Square
```JavaScript
PlotAxes.make({
  axis: 'equal'
}).fill({
  args: [
    [ 1, 2, 2, 1, 1 ],
    [ 1, 1, 2, 2, 1 ],
    'r'
  ]
}).show();
```

# Example: Checkerboard
```JavaScript
var ax = PlotAxes.make({
  axis: 'equal',
  title: 'Checkerboard'
});
for (var i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
  for (var j = 0; j < 8; j++) {
    if (i % 2 != j % 2) {
      ax = ax.fill({
        args: [
          [ i, i + 1, i + 1, i, i ],
          [ j, j, j + 1, j + 1, j ],
          'k'
        ]
      });
    }
  }
}
ax.show();
```

